cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference Heybe, please cite it as below."
title: "Heybe: open-source personal AI assistant for Mac"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Slovian Inc"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Slovian42/Heybe"
url: "https://heybe.dev"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Heybe is a local-first personal AI assistant (AI agent) that runs on your Mac,
  executes actions in a sandbox by default and asks for approval before sensitive
  actions. It supports DeepSeek by default, bring-your-own OpenAI or Claude API keys,
  and local models through Ollama.
keywords:
  - personal AI assistant
  - local AI agent
  - self-hosted
  - macOS
  - sandbox
  - bring your own key
  - DeepSeek
  - Ollama
